          "_name": "article22",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article22\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/customer-experiene-tech-1920x1080.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0098ff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Services Experiences</b><br><b>服务经验</b></h5>\n          <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">We provide construction, design, consulting, and customized solutions suitable for your company. In addition, the field of RFID solutions, including IoT solutions, RTLS solutions, and security solutions, involves different designs and constructions of over 250 cases, with different types of RFID solution applications<br>我们提供适合贵公司的施工、设计、咨询和定制解决方案。此外，RFID解决方案领域，包括物联网解决方案、RTLS解决方案和安全解决方案，涉及250多个案例的不同设计和构造，具有不同类型的RFID解决方案应用</h6>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n            <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n          <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n            <ol>\n              <li><b>RFID Solution -</b>&nbsp;School, Bank, Warehouse, Hotel, Hospital, Healthcare, Retail, Office and Manufactory.(RFID解决方案-学校、银行、仓库、酒店、医院、医疗保健、零售、办公室和制造厂。)</li>\n              <li><b>UWB Solution -&nbsp;</b>Hospital and prison.(UWB解决方案-医院和监狱。)</li>\n              <li><b>IoT Platform -</b>&nbsp;Hospital, University and Data center.(物联网平台-医院、大学和数据中心。)</li>\n            </ol>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
